 187:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/md.h ****  *                  to use.
 188:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/md.h ****  * \param hmac      Defines if HMAC is used. 0: HMAC is not used (saves some memory),
